# COPIED-CALLABLE-ACTUAL (steps/defects.md), a required positive, red natively: b1\peek selects b1's own occurrence of
# peek, under C, the copy of the unit made at b1's merge, whose cnt keeps 1 after the root writes 5; peek adds its
# node's cnt to the root's a3\x.  Through the formal f, then by the direct path call: 1, then 2.  Natively the actual
# is the unit's own occurrence (l2_cf_actual_emit), whose node holds 5: 81; the walked root hands the path's
# occurrence.  HEAD refused the free input a3 in every mode.  Exit 7; 81 or 82 otherwise.
int: cnt 1
Wide:
    int: x 0
end: Wide
sub: peek ()
    a3\x: a3\x + node\cnt
end: peek
Box:
    int: v 0
    fn: peek
end: Box
fn: recv (peek: f) int
    f()
    return: 0
end: recv
b1: merge: Box
a3: merge: Wide
cnt: 5
int: r recv(b1\peek)
int: ok 7
if: a3\x != 1
    ok: 81
b1\peek()
if: ok = 7 && a3\x != 2
    ok: 82
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
